                                    "text": "<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\"><strong>Hey {{ First_Name }}!<br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">I'm Daniele D'Ambrosio, creator of <strong>Tricky Dragons</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">First off, thank you for supporting <strong>Tricky Dragons</strong>! 🙏</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">Welcome to the magical world of Tricky Dragons. Your $1 reservation made you a <strong>VIP&nbsp;</strong>with exclusive access to some pretty cool perks! Here's what that means for you...</p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"line-height: 19.6px;\"><strong>🔥Get our bonus Exclusive Mini Expansion</strong> when you back Tricky Dragons on Kickstarter. Your Exclusive Mini Expansion will be added to your pledge manager cart after the campaign ends.</li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 19.6px;\"><strong>👀Get behind-the-scenes access</strong>&nbsp;to our campaign page. Once we are further along, we'll give you access to our draft campaign page so you can ask questions and give feedback.<br><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"{{ FACEBOOK_VIP_GROUP_LINK }}\" target=\"_blank\" data-u-link-value=\"eyJuYW1lIjoid2ViIiwiYXR0cnMiOnsiaHJlZiI6Int7aHJlZn19IiwidGFyZ2V0Ijoie3t0YXJnZXR9fSJ9LCJ2YWx1ZXMiOnsiaHJlZiI6Int7RkFDRUJPT0tfTElOS319IiwidGFyZ2V0IjoiX2JsYW5rIn19\"></a></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 19.6px;\"><strong><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"{{ FACEBOOK_VIP_GROUP_LINK }}\" target=\"_blank\" data-u-link-value=\"eyJuYW1lIjoid2ViIiwiYXR0cnMiOnsiaHJlZiI6Int7aHJlZn19IiwidGFyZ2V0Ijoie3t0YXJnZXR9fSJ9LCJ2YWx1ZXMiOnsiaHJlZiI6Int7IEZBQ0VCT09LX1ZJUF9HUk9VUF9MSU5LIH19IiwidGFyZ2V0IjoiX2JsYW5rIn19\">Join our VIP ONLY Facebook Group</a></strong> where you can chat with our team and the rest of the Tricky Dragons community.</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"line-height: 140%;\">As we gear up for the launch, be sure to join our Private Facebook Group where our dragons will keep you updated.</p>",
